        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sheehy Meares Real Estate are delighted to present 34 Garbally Oaks, Upper Brackernagh, Ballinasloe, Co. Galway a substantial five bedroom, four bathroom detached residence extending to approximately 214.39 sq. metres and arranged over three floors.\n\nBuilt in 2007, this impressive property benefits from a B energy rating and offers spacious, modern living accommodation throughout.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway. To the right is a large sitting room, accessed through double doors and featuring a solid fuel stove. The modern fitted kitchen and dining area includes integrated appliances and connects seamlessly with a comfortable living area to the rear. A well-equipped utility room provides additional fitted storage and appliance space, while a guest WC completes the ground-floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers four generously proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite facilities. Each bedroom benefits from built-in storage. A spacious landing and main family bathroom, complete with a bath, serve the remaining bedrooms.\n\nGarbally Oaks is a mature and well-established residential development located in Upper Brackernagh, within Ballinasloe town. The property is conveniently situated close to local shops, Portiuncula University Hospital, Ballinasloe Train Station and the M6 Dublin to Galway motorway, providing excellent access to local amenities and transport links.\n\nThe property benefits from gas fired central heating, with services including ESB, mains water and mains sewage.\n\nOffering generous accommodation, a strong B energy rating and an excellent location, 34 Garbally Oaks presents an ideal opportunity to acquire a substantial family home in Ballinasloe.\n\nContact the selling agent, Cathal Meares, for further details or to arrange a viewing."
